# The golden fixtures in docs/protocol are hashed byte for byte
# (parity/golden-fixtures.json), and the C# and Rust suites check those hashes
# on every operating system. Check them out exactly as stored, so Windows
# runners with core.autocrlf=true do not turn LF into CRLF (issue #111).
# node parity/check-parity.mjs fails if a fixture loses this attribute.
docs/protocol/** -text
